    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37378" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praecentor</span></b> , ōris, m.
		praecino, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a leader</i> in music, <i>precentor</i> (post-class.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praecentor in choris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">App. Mund. p. 74, 3</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praecentor qui vocem praemittit (opp.
					succentor),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Aug. Enarr. in Psa. 87</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Isid. 7, 12, 27</span></i>.</div>
